  "summary": "CasperVMakerHTTPx86 (\"Maker 2021329\") is a ShadowPad builder that generates two files: a legitimate AppLaunch.exe copy that DLL side-loads a Casper Loader mscoree.dll, which decodes and executes embedded ShadowPad shellcode using a custom XOR/PRNG key schedule. The loader's exports (IEE2, LoadLibraryShim2, LoadStringRC2) and fixed crypto constants match Casper Loaders seen in Tick intrusions and the CVE-2021-44515 ManageEngine campaign.",
